OL,3,GNEWSAFootball club to run health
OL,4,Aprogramme at stadium
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthampton Town Football Club has
OL,7,Finvited men wanting to become more
OL,8,Factive to join a 12-week health
OL,9,Fprogramme at its stadium.
OL,11,FChances for Change will run on Thursday
OL,12,Fevenings between 24 September and 17
OL,13,FDecember at Sixfields Stadium.
OL,15,FThe free sessions, which include
OL,16,Fphysical activity and health education,
OL,17,Fare open to men aged 30 to 70 and with
OL,18,Fa BMI of 27.5 or above.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,368,360,200,160,0,100
